---
import { site } from "../data/site";
import "../styles/careers-landing.css";
---

<section id="gg-careers-v3" aria-labelledby="ggc-page-title" data-careers-landing>
  <header class="ggc-hero">
    <div class="ggc-shell ggc-hero-grid">
      <div class="motion-rise">
        <p class="ggc-kicker">Careers at Grow Green</p>
        <h1 id="ggc-page-title">Good work. Real responsibility. A team that notices.</h1>
        <p class="ggc-hero-lead">
          Build a career with a firefighter-owned lawn treatment company trusted across South
          Louisiana. We train good people, reward strong performance, and take pride in doing the
          job right.
        </p>
        <div class="ggc-hero-actions">
          <a class="ggc-button" href="#ggc-openings">See open positions <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
          <a class="ggc-button ggc-button--light" id="ggc-hero-apply" href="#ggc-apply">Apply now</a>
        </div>
        <div class="ggc-open-status" id="ggc-opening-count" role="status" aria-live="polite">
          Loading current openings…
        </div>
        <ul class="ggc-hero-points" aria-label="Career highlights">
          <li>Local routes</li>
          <li>Hands-on training</li>
          <li>Performance rewarded</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="ggc-hero-visual motion-rise motion-delay-2" aria-label="Grow Green team mascot">
        <div class="ggc-mascot-stage">
          <img
            src="/images/mascot/firefighter.png"
            alt="Grow Green Weed Control mascot"
            width="430"
            height="560"
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="ggc-visual-note">
          <strong>Specialized work</strong>
          We specialize in lawn treatments and outdoor pest care for South Louisiana properties.
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="ggc-value-rail" aria-label="Why work at Grow Green">
    <div class="ggc-shell ggc-value-grid">
      <div class="ggc-value">
        <strong>Competitive pay</strong>
        <span>Current ranges appear with each open position.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ggc-value">
        <strong>Production commission</strong>
        <span>Strong field performance can earn more.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ggc-value">
        <strong>Paid training</strong>
        <span>Learn our standards, tools, and lawn program.</span>
      </div>
      <div class="ggc-value">
        <strong>Room to advance</strong>
        <span>Build skill, ownership, and responsibility.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Main landmark: parity tooling compares stored careers.json text to rendered <main> -->
  <main>
    <section class="ggc-section ggc-openings-section" id="ggc-openings" aria-labelledby="ggc-openings-title">
      <div class="ggc-shell">
        <div class="ggc-section-head">
          <div>
            <p class="ggc-kicker">Current opportunities</p>
            <h2 id="ggc-openings-title">Find the role that fits you.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Open positions and pay are updated directly by our hiring team, so what you see here is current.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ggc-openings-grid" id="ggc-openings-list" aria-live="polite" aria-busy="true">
          <div class="ggc-loading-card" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="ggc-loading-card" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ggc-role-panel" id="ggc-role-panel" hidden aria-live="polite"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ggc-section ggc-why-section" aria-labelledby="ggc-why-title">
      <div class="ggc-shell">
        <div class="ggc-section-head">
          <div>
            <p class="ggc-kicker">What you can expect</p>
            <h2 id="ggc-why-title">A small team with high standards.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            You will be trusted to own your work, communicate clearly, and take care of customers as
            if their lawn were your own.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ggc-why-grid">
          <article class="ggc-why-item">
            <span class="ggc-why-number">01</span>
            <h3>Independence with support</h3>
            <p>Handle your responsibilities confidently while knowing the team is available when something needs attention.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ggc-why-item">
            <span class="ggc-why-number">02</span>
            <h3>Work that has a result</h3>
            <p>Whether you are treating lawns or supporting routes, your effort is visible in the customer experience.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ggc-why-item">
            <span class="ggc-why-number">03</span>
            <h3>Performance matters</h3>
            <p>Quality, reliability, efficiency, and follow-through are recognized—not lost inside a huge company.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ggc-why-item">
            <span class="ggc-why-number">04</span>
            <h3>Grow your skills</h3>
            <p>Learn practical systems, sharpen your judgment, and earn greater responsibility as the company grows.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
        <p class="ggc-benefit-note">
          Eligible full-time positions may include health, dental, vision, 401(k) matching, and paid
          time off. Eligibility varies by position and will be confirmed during the hiring process.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ggc-section ggc-process" aria-labelledby="ggc-process-title">
      <div class="ggc-shell">
        <div class="ggc-section-head">
          <div>
            <p class="ggc-kicker">The hiring process</p>
            <h2 id="ggc-process-title">Straightforward from the start.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>
            Give us a clear picture of your experience and availability. If there is a fit, our team
            will contact you about the next step.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="ggc-process-grid">
          <article class="ggc-process-step">
            <h3>Apply online</h3>
            <p>Choose an open role and complete the short application. A résumé is helpful but optional.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ggc-process-step">
            <h3>We review it</h3>
            <p>Our hiring team reviews your application, experience, availability, and role-specific answers.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="ggc-process-step">
            <h3>We reach out</h3>
            <p>If your background matches the role, we will contact you to discuss the opportunity and next steps.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="ggc-section ggc-apply-section" id="ggc-apply" aria-labelledby="ggc-form-title">
      <div class="ggc-shell ggc-apply-grid">
        <aside class="ggc-apply-aside">
          <h3>Ready to apply?</h3>
          <p>The application is broken into three short steps and usually takes only a few minutes.</p>
          <div class="ggc-aside-role">
            <span>Selected position</span>
            <strong id="ggc-selected-role-label">Loading openings…</strong>
          </div>
          <ul class="ggc-aside-list">
            <li>Your résumé is optional.</li>
            <li>Your information goes directly to our private hiring workflow.</li>
            <li>Applications are kept separate from customer leads.</li>
          </ul>
        </aside>

        <div class="ggc-form-card">
          <div id="ggc-form-experience">
            <div class="ggc-form-top">
              <h2 id="ggc-form-title">Join the Grow Green team</h2>
              <p>Fields marked with <span aria-hidden="true">*</span> are required.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="ggc-form-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span id="ggc-progress-bar"></span></div>
            <div class="ggc-step-pills" aria-label="Application progress">
              <div class="ggc-step-pill is-active" data-step-pill="0"><span>1</span><b>About you</b></div>
              <div class="ggc-step-pill" data-step-pill="1"><span>2</span><b>Experience</b></div>
              <div class="ggc-step-pill" data-step-pill="2"><span>3</span><b>Finish</b></div>
            </div>

            <form id="ggc-application-form" class="ggc-form-body" enctype="multipart/form-data" novalidate>
              <div class="ggc-form-step" data-form-step="0">
                <h3 tabindex="-1">Start with the basics</h3>
                <p class="ggc-step-intro">Choose your position and tell us how to reach you.</p>
                <div class="ggc-fields">
                  <div class="ggc-field ggc-field--full">
                    <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-job">Position</label>
                    <select id="ggc-job" name="job_opening_slug" required disabled>
                      <option value="">Loading current openings…</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field">
                    <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-first-name">First name</label>
                    <input id="ggc-first-name" name="first_name" type="text" autocomplete="given-name" maxlength="80" required />
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field">
                    <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-last-name">Last name</label>
                    <input id="ggc-last-name" name="last_name" type="text" autocomplete="family-name" maxlength="80" required />
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field">
                    <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-email">Email</label>
                    <input id="ggc-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required />
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field">
                    <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-phone">Phone</label>
                    <input id="ggc-phone" name="phone" type="tel" inputmode="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="24" placeholder="(225) 555-0123" required />
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field ggc-field--third">
                    <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-city">City</label>
                    <input id="ggc-city" name="city" type="text" autocomplete="address-level2" maxlength="100" required />
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field ggc-field--third">
                    <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-state">State</label>
                    <select id="ggc-state" name="state" autocomplete="address-level1" required>
                      <option value="LA" selected>Louisiana</option>
                      <option value="MS">Mississippi</option>
                      <option value="TX">Texas</option>
                      <option value="AL">Alabama</option>
                      <option value="AR">Arkansas</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field ggc-field--third">
                    <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-zip">ZIP code</label>
                    <input id="ggc-zip" name="zip" type="text" inputmode="numeric" autocomplete="postal-code" maxlength="10" placeholder="70737" required />
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="ggc-form-actions">
                  <span></span>
                  <div class="ggc-action-right">
                    <button class="ggc-button ggc-button--green" id="ggc-first-next" type="button" data-next disabled>
                      Continue <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                    </button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="ggc-form-step" data-form-step="1" hidden>
                <h3 tabindex="-1">Experience and availability</h3>
                <p class="ggc-step-intro">No lawn-treatment experience? That is okay—we train the right people.</p>
                <div class="ggc-fields">
                  <div class="ggc-field">
                    <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-start-date">Earliest start date</label>
                    <input id="ggc-start-date" name="earliest_start_date" type="date" required />
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field">
                    <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-availability">General availability</label>
                    <input id="ggc-availability" name="availability" type="text" maxlength="300" placeholder="Days, times, and any schedule limits" required />
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field">
                    <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-work-auth">Authorized to work in the U.S.?</label>
                    <select id="ggc-work-auth" name="work_authorized" required>
                      <option value="">Select an answer</option>
                      <option value="yes">Yes</option>
                      <option value="no">No</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field">
                    <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-sponsorship">Will you require employment sponsorship?</label>
                    <select id="ggc-sponsorship" name="sponsorship_required" required>
                      <option value="">Select an answer</option>
                      <option value="no">No</option>
                      <option value="yes">Yes</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field ggc-field--full">
                    <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-experience">Relevant experience or work history</label>
                    <textarea id="ggc-experience" name="experience_summary" maxlength="3000" placeholder="Tell us about your recent work, useful skills, customer service experience, equipment experience, or why you are ready to learn." required></textarea>
                  </div>

                  <div class="ggc-screening-box" id="ggc-tech-screening" hidden>
                    <h4>Field-role requirements</h4>
                    <p>Please answer each question honestly. The essential-functions question includes reasonable accommodation.</p>
                    <div class="ggc-screening-fields">
                      <div class="ggc-field ggc-field--full">
                        <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-license">Do you have a valid driver’s license?</label>
                        <select id="ggc-license" name="valid_drivers_license" disabled>
                          <option value="">Select an answer</option>
                          <option value="yes">Yes</option>
                          <option value="no">No</option>
                        </select>
                      </div>
                      <div class="ggc-field ggc-field--full">
                        <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-driving">Do you have an insurable driving record?</label>
                        <select id="ggc-driving" name="insurable_driving_record" disabled>
                          <option value="">Select an answer</option>
                          <option value="yes">Yes</option>
                          <option value="no">No</option>
                        </select>
                      </div>
                      <div class="ggc-field ggc-field--full">
                        <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-functions">Can you perform the essential functions of this job, with or without reasonable accommodation?</label>
                        <select id="ggc-functions" name="can_perform_essential_functions" disabled>
                          <option value="">Select an answer</option>
                          <option value="yes">Yes</option>
                          <option value="no">No</option>
                        </select>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <div class="ggc-field">
                    <label for="ggc-source">How did you hear about us?</label>
                    <select id="ggc-source" name="referral_source">
                      <option value="website">Grow Green website</option>
                      <option value="indeed">Indeed</option>
                      <option value="facebook">Facebook</option>
                      <option value="google">Google</option>
                      <option value="employee">Current employee</option>
                      <option value="craigslist">Craigslist</option>
                      <option value="other">Other</option>
                    </select>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field" id="ggc-referral-name-wrap" hidden>
                    <label for="ggc-referral-name">Employee’s name</label>
                    <input id="ggc-referral-name" name="referral_employee_name" type="text" maxlength="150" />
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="ggc-form-actions">
                  <button class="ggc-button ggc-button--ghost" type="button" data-prev><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Back</button>
                  <div class="ggc-action-right">
                    <button class="ggc-button ggc-button--green" type="button" data-next>Continue <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="ggc-form-step" data-form-step="2" hidden>
                <h3 tabindex="-1">Finish your application</h3>
                <p class="ggc-step-intro">Tell us why this role interests you. A résumé is optional.</p>
                <div class="ggc-fields">
                  <div class="ggc-field ggc-field--full">
                    <label class="ggc-required" for="ggc-fit">Why would you be a good fit for Grow Green?</label>
                    <textarea id="ggc-fit" name="why_good_fit" maxlength="3000" placeholder="A few thoughtful sentences are perfect." required></textarea>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field ggc-field--full">
                    <span class="ggc-help ggc-file-label">Résumé <span>(optional)</span></span>
                    <div class="ggc-file-zone">
                      <input
                        id="ggc-resume"
                        name="resume"
                        type="file"
                        accept=".pdf,.doc,.docx,application/pdf,application/msword,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document"
                      />
                      <label for="ggc-resume">
                        <strong id="ggc-file-title">Choose your résumé</strong>
                        <span id="ggc-file-detail">PDF, DOC, or DOCX · maximum 10 MB</span>
                      </label>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field ggc-field--full">
                    <label for="ggc-notes">Anything else we should know? <span class="ggc-optional">(optional)</span></label>
                    <textarea id="ggc-notes" name="additional_notes" maxlength="3000" placeholder="Certifications, scheduling details, or anything else that may help us review your application."></textarea>
                  </div>
                  <div class="ggc-field ggc-field--full">
                    <div class="ggc-checkbox-row">
                      <input id="ggc-sms-opt-in" name="sms_opt_in" type="checkbox" value="yes" />
                      <label for="ggc-sms-opt-in">
                        I agree to receive text messages from Grow Green Weed Control about my job
                        application, including interview scheduling and application updates. Message
                        and data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out. This is optional and is not
                        consent to marketing.
                      </label>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <p class="ggc-submit-note">
                  By submitting, you agree that Grow Green Weed Control may contact you about this
                  employment application. Text-message consent above is optional and separate. See
                  our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a>.
                </p>

                <input type="hidden" name="sms_consent_language" id="ggc-sms-language" value="" />
                <input type="hidden" name="utm_source" id="ggc-utm-source" value="" />
                <input type="hidden" name="utm_medium" id="ggc-utm-medium" value="" />
                <input type="hidden" name="utm_campaign" id="ggc-utm-campaign" value="" />
                <input type="hidden" name="utm_term" id="ggc-utm-term" value="" />
                <input type="hidden" name="utm_content" id="ggc-utm-content" value="" />
                <input type="hidden" name="gclid" id="ggc-gclid" value="" />
                <input type="hidden" name="fbclid" id="ggc-fbclid" value="" />
                <input type="hidden" name="page_url" id="ggc-page-url" value="" />
                <input type="hidden" name="referrer" id="ggc-referrer" value="" />
                <input type="hidden" name="device_info" id="ggc-device" value="" />
                <input type="hidden" name="idempotency_key" id="ggc-idempotency" value="" />
                <div aria-hidden="true" class="ggc-honeypot">
                  <label for="ggc-website">Website</label>
                  <input id="ggc-website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
                </div>

                <div class="ggc-form-actions">
                  <button class="ggc-button ggc-button--ghost" type="button" data-prev><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Back</button>
                  <div class="ggc-action-right">
                    <button class="ggc-button ggc-submit-button" id="ggc-submit" type="submit">Submit application</button>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div id="ggc-form-message" role="alert" aria-live="assertive" hidden></div>
            </form>
          </div>

          <div class="ggc-success-panel" id="ggc-success" role="status" tabindex="-1" hidden>
            <div class="ggc-success-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
            <h3>Application received.</h3>
            <p>
              Thank you for your interest in Grow Green. Our hiring team will review your information
              and contact you if your background matches the position.
            </p>
            <button class="ggc-button ggc-button--ghost" id="ggc-submit-another" type="button">
              Submit another application
            </button>
          </div>

          <noscript>
            <p class="ggc-noscript">
              JavaScript is required to load current openings and securely submit this application.
              Please call <a href={`tel:${site.phoneTel}`}>{site.phone}</a> for assistance.
            </p>
          </noscript>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</section>

<script>
  import "../scripts/careers-page.ts";
</script>
